# Upload only what the site build needs (site + web demo + Go to record fixtures). Vercel installs deps itself.
.git
**/node_modules
# No blanket **/dist: web/design-system/dist and web/dist hold committed files the build needs.
site/dist
web/dist-demo
packages/*/dist
web/demo-data
site/src/generated
site/docs/.vitepress/cache
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.superpowers
*.db
*.db-*
*.log
/trail
demo-password.txt
.env*
